flowchart TD
    start([Start: Jira ticket key]) --> ticket[Read ticket through Atlassian MCP]
    ticket --> plan[Create a structured implementation plan]
    plan --> planApproval{{Human plan approval}}
    planApproval -->|Revise| plan
    planApproval -->|Reject| stop([Stop])
    planApproval -->|Approve| branch[Create or reuse agent/TICKET branch]
    branch --> implement[Codex implements approved plan]
    implement --> validate[Run configured validation]
    validate -->|Failed| validationFailed([Stop: validation failure])
    validate -->|No new files| noChanges([Stop: nothing to publish])
    validate -->|Passed| publishApproval{{Human path + push approval}}
    publishApproval -->|Reject| stop
    publishApproval -->|Approve selected paths| publish[Commit, push, create draft PR]
    publish --> done([Done])
